As a Freight Forwarder your day-to-day responsibilities include:


• Managing export files from A to Z for both FCL and LCL shipments;

• Maintaining daily contact with customers and proactively monitoring their shipments;

• Organizing and coordinating pre-carriage and on-carriage transport with logistics partners;

• Liaising with shipping lines for operational follow-up;

• Working closely with the customs team to ensure accurate and compliant documentation;

• Ensuring correct invoicing and administrative processing of shipments;

• Monitoring and adhering to all applicable quality, safety, and compliance standards.

As a Freight Forwarder, you bring the following qualifications and skills:


• Several years of experience in freight forwarding, with a strong focus on ocean freight exports;

• Fluent in English and/or Dutch;

• Comfortable working with new IT systems and logistics software;

• Able to work independently, accurately, and customer-focused;

• Strong organizational skills and the ability to efficiently manage multiple files and priorities simultaneously.
